<view class="page"><view class="brand"><text class="mark">¥</text><text>旅费有数</text><text class="beta">BETA</text></view><text class="eyebrow">出发前，先知道要花多少</text><text class="headline">这趟旅行，<text>大概要花多少？</text></text><view class="card form"><text class="label">去哪里</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{cityNames}}" value="{{cityNames.indexOf(destination)}}" bindchange="setDestination"><view class="input">{{destination}} <text>⌄</text></view></picker><view class="row"><view><text class="label">玩几天</text><input type="number" value="{{days}}" bindinput="setDays"/></view><view><text class="label">几个人</text><input type="number" value="{{people}}" bindinput="setPeople"/></view></view><text class="label">旅行风格</text><view class="seg"><block xhs:for="{{['省钱','舒适','放松']}}"><button class="{{style===item?'active':''}}" data-style="{{item}}" bindtap="setStyle">{{item}}</button></block></view></view><view class="result"><text class="eyebrow">预计总花费</text><text class="total">¥{{Math.round(total).toLocaleString()}}</text><text class="per">约 ¥{{Math.round(perDay).toLocaleString()}} / 天</text><view class="line"><text>交通</text><text>¥{{Math.round(transport).toLocaleString()}}</text></view><view class="line"><text>住宿</text><text>¥{{Math.round(hotel).toLocaleString()}}</text></view><view class="line"><text>餐饮</text><text>¥{{Math.round(food).toLocaleString()}}</text></view><view class="line"><text>门票 / 购物 / 机动</text><text>¥{{Math.round(tickets+shopping+misc).toLocaleString()}}</text></view><button class="share" bindtap="copyBudget">复制我的旅行预算卡 ↗</button></view><text class="foot">城市消费档位估算 · 价格随日期变化</text></view>
